  "description": "Clean Architecture template — Infrastructure cross-cutting remainder: idempotency stores (in-memory + Redis), reusable health checks (DbConnection / HTTP / TCP port + JSON response writer), and the Vault JSON configuration source (AddVaultSecrets). Persistence (AppDbContext, EfRepository, EF interceptors, Dapper, bulk, soft-delete, transactions) moved to SU2.C15e.Infrastructure.Persistence and Audit.NET wiring to SU2.C15e.Infrastructure.Auditing in the 2.0.0 split — see docs/template-packaging/migration-2.0.0-infrastructure-persistence-split.md. Numeronym `C15e` = CleanArchitecture. Generation 2026 series.",
